      "id": 100,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## kldload \u2014 platform footprint (the honest accounting)\n\nWhat does kldload itself cost you to run? This dashboard shows the CPU, RAM, FDs, and threads of every kldload-shipped daemon AND the observability stack itself (Prometheus, Loki, Grafana, promtail, exporters). Most platforms don't show their own footprint. We do.\n\n**Rule of thumb on a healthy box**: total kldload + observability stack should sit around 5-10% of total CPU and 1-2GB RAM. If it's eating more, tune."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "CPU consumed by the platform itself",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 110,
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Top 12 process groups by CPU rate (kldload + observability)",
      "description": "Per-process-group user+sys CPU. The platform should be the bottom band; your workloads should dominate.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 111,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "topk(12, sum by (groupname) (rate(namedprocess_namegroup_cpu_seconds_total{groupname=~'kldload.*|klab.*|grafana|loki|prometheus|promtail|node_exporter|libvirt-exporte|process-exporte|smartctl_export|smartd|zfs_exporter|ebpf_exporter|tetragon|cilium-agent|hubble.*|ttyd|nginx'}[2m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{groupname}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 25,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Memory consumed by the platform itself",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "id": 120,
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Top 12 process groups by RSS",
      "description": "Resident set size per group. Grafana + Loki + Prometheus are the usual top of the list; the kldload daemons themselves are usually under 100MB each.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "id": 121,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "topk(12, sum by (groupname) (namedprocess_namegroup_memory_bytes{groupname=~'kldload.*|klab.*|grafana|loki|prometheus|promtail|node_exporter|libvirt-exporte|process-exporte|smartctl_export|smartd|zfs_exporter|ebpf_exporter|tetragon|cilium-agent|hubble.*|ttyd|nginx', memtype='resident'}))",
          "legendFormat": "{{groupname}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 25,
